# The Pyodide wheel job (tools/ci/pyodide): pyodide-build builds rvt-py for Pyodide, maturin is its backend,
# marimo exports the example notebook to a static site. pyodide-build 0.39.4 and marimo 0.25.2 come from their
# own release workflows (PyPI provenance attestations: pyodide/pyodide-build release.yml, marimo-team/marimo
# release.yml); pure Python wheels, no install-time scripts. requirements.txt pins every dependency with its
# hashes (Python 3.14, the version Pyodide 314 runs), and pip installs it with --require-hashes; after changing a
# pin here, regenerate it with the uv command at its top.
pyodide-build==0.39.4
maturin==1.16.0
marimo==0.25.2
